--- !u!114 &4269626574004924306
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1726664202306173363}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 643c0a4661bf5824bbf5cea05d31a695, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tips:
  - Diverting power to <color=red>WEAPONS</color> greatly increases damage output.
  - Diverting power to <color=blue>SHIELDS</color> reduces damage taken. It also
    speeds up shields regeneration.
  - Diverting power to <color=yellow>THRUSTERS</color> increases move speed and shooting/charging
    move speed.
  - Unlocking new spaceships allow for their ability to be dropped in game.
  - Different abilities are useful for different situations. Switch them up if needed!
  - Spaceship upgrades are lost upon death, so try to avoid that.
  - Enjoying the game? Then leave a positive review and recommend it to your friends!
  - Encountered a bug? Don't hesitate to use the in-game feedback button!
  - After a few seconds of not taking any damage, your spaceship's shields start
    regenerating.
  - A fully charged beam cannon has increased critical hit chance!
  - Having a hard time getting past a boss? Try upgrading your spaceship or but a
    better one!
  - Each spaceship is unique. Try them all!
  tipText: {fileID: 1726664203382146283}
